      "writtenOn": "2026-08-28T03:34:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I used `std::multiset\u003cpkg::Descriptor\u003e` instead, behind a `pkg::SortedDescriptors` alias, to order by the whole entry. `pkg::Descriptors` is a multimap keyed on `DescriptorType`, so entries sharing a type are ordered only by insertion — that is the bug this change fixes.",
